  "_comment": "Wan 2.2 14B MoE i2v + a STYLE LoRA on both experts. Identical sampling recipe to wan22_14b_i2v_fp8.json (high-noise raw at cfg 3.5 for motion, lightning on low-noise for detail speed, shift 8.0); the only difference is nodes 18/19, which apply the style LoRA named in model_map's style_lora. Both experts get it: the high-noise pass shapes composition/motion, the low-noise pass carries surface style, so styling only one leaves the look half-applied. resolve.py fills lora_name/strength for any LoraLoaderModelOnly whose placeholder name contains STYLE, and leaves the lightning loader (node 17) alone.",
